      "style": "object",
      "text": {
        "en": "Openwork Dragon Mirror",
        "zh": "蟠螭纹透雕镜"
      },
      "words": 4,
      "lines": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "caption.02",
      "bay": 2,
      "label": "CAPTION 02 · 40–60 WORDS / ≤4 LINES",
      "x": 6.35,
      "y": 1.59,
      "w": 1.7,
      "h": 0.3,
      "align": "left",
      "style": "caption",
      "text": {
        "en": "From the Metropolitan Museum, this small mirror is built in two layers: a Warring States openwork plaque of interlaced dragons, confirmed as period, set before a plain backing plate the museum notes may be a later replacement. Both layers are modelled separately in the viewer.",
        "zh": "此镜藏于大都会艺术博物馆，为双层结构：战国时期蟠螭纹透雕饰片（馆方确认为原物）置于素面镜体之前，而后方镜体可能为后世配补。观赏器已将两层分离建模，可转动细看。"
      },
      "words": 60,
      "lines": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "meta.02",
      "bay": 2,
      "label": "DATE / MEDIUM / LENDER",
      "x": 6.35,
      "y": 1.44,
      "w": 1.7,
      "h": 0.07,
      "align": "left",
      "style": "meta",
      "text": {
        "en": "China · Warring States (openwork) · Bronze · The Metropolitan Museum of Art, 23.120.5",
        "zh": "中国 · 战国（透雕层） · 青铜 · 大都会艺术博物馆 23.120.5"
      },
      "lines": 1
    },
