        "en": "TLV (Guiju) Mirror",
        "zh": "规矩（博局）镜"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "caption.03",
      "bay": 3,
      "label": "CAPTION 06 · 40–60 WORDS / ≤4 LINES",
      "x": 8.35,
      "y": 1.59,
      "w": 1.7,
      "h": 0.3,
      "words": 60,
      "lines": 4,
      "align": "left",
      "style": "caption",
      "text": {
        "en": "The type made famous by Wu Hung's reading of it as a cosmic diagram: the T, L and V marks trace the liubo game board and the square Bright Hall, while the four spirits — dragon, tiger, bird and tortoise-snake — guard the cardinal points around the central knob and its twelve nipples.",
        "zh": "即巫鸿所释的“宇宙图式”之镜：T、L、V 纹对应博局与明堂方院，青龙、白虎、朱雀、玄武四神分守四方，环绕中央镜钮与十二乳钉，把天地秩序铸于镜背。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "meta.03",
      "bay": 3,
      "label": "DATE / MEDIUM / LENDER",
      "x": 8.35,
      "y": 1.44,
