      "text": {
        "en": "A late-Qing hand mirror from the Palace Museum: a bronze disc covered in translucent cobalt-blue enamel, painted with gilt double-happiness characters and the Eight Treasures, set on a matching enamelled handle. Hold it in the viewer as it was once held in the hand.",
        "zh": "此镜为北京故宫博物院藏清晚期把镜：铜胎施透明蓝珐琅，描金双喜字与八宝纹，下接同饰珐琅长柄。请在观赏器中拿起它，如百年前一样对镜执照。"
      }
